Package: taskflow-native
Version: 1.3.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Taskflow Maintainers <support@example.com>
Depends: ca-certificates, curl, git, python3, python3-venv, python3-dev, postgresql, postgresql-contrib, redis-server, rabbitmq-server
Description: Taskflow native self-hosted installation without Docker
 Taskflow native installer for Linux. Includes service files and setup automation
 for PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ, MinIO, Django API, Celery workers and frontend apps.
